title: essence_endures
---
Elder Guardian: Their memory, their impact on you, the love you shared - these cannot be consumed. In time, you may see them in new ways. As stars, perhaps.
-> Stars?
    <<jump constellation_hint>>
-> I'll hold onto their memory
    <<jump encouragement>>
===
title: mutual_understanding
---
Elder Guardian: We share this burden, then. And together, we'll ensure no one else falls victim to the Veil Maiden's manipulation.
-> Together
    <<jump path_forward>>
-> Thank you
    <<stop>>
