title: depths_explanation
---
Elder Guardian: The Hollow Depths is where the Veil Maiden sends those she breaks. A place of emptiness, where light struggles to exist. You escaped. That's remarkable.
-> It felt like drowning
    <<jump validation>>
-> How do I recover from it?
    <<jump path_forward>>
===
title: find_lanterns
---
Elder Guardian: Some have returned to the hub. Others gather in quiet corners. Speak to them - they won't judge. They've been where you are.
-> I will
    <<stop>>
-> What if I'm not ready?
    <<jump take_your_time>>
===
title: lanterns_purpose
---
Elder Guardian: They're not warriors, but supporters. They'll listen, share their stories, remind you that recovery is possible. That's a different kind of strength.
-> I understand
    <<jump encouragement>>
-> I'll seek them out
    <<stop>>
===
title: constellation_hint
---
Elder Guardian: Just a thought. Sometimes what we lose doesn't disappear - it transforms. Becomes distant, but still visible. Still watching over us.
-> That's... comforting
    <<jump encouragement>>
-> I hope you're right
    <<stop>>
===
title: validation
---
Elder Guardian: And you survived. That alone shows your strength. Now, let that strength rebuild what was lost.
-> I'll try
    <<jump path_forward>>
-> Thank you for understanding
    <<stop>>
===
title: take_your_time
---
Elder Guardian: Then wait until you are. Healing has no timeline. When you're ready, they'll be there. We'll all be here.
<<fire_event act2_elder_patience_shown>>
<<stop>>
